# Architecture

[docs/architecture.md](../../docs/architecture.md)

- FVM; feature-first `lib/app`, `lib/core`, `lib/features/{home,clients,vouchers,suppliers,items,statements}`.
- Riverpod + go_router (shell only) + Drift.
- UI → repository interface → Drift; no SQL in widgets.
- No backend/auth/sync scaffold in V1; interfaces stay swap-friendly for V2.

Nested navigator inside bottom sheets is **not** go_router.
